{
  "name": "automated-codejson-generator",
  "version": "1.2.1",
  "description": "Github Action that allows for automated code.json creation and maintenance ",
  "longDescription": "This GitHub Action is designed to streamline the maintenance and compliance of code.json files within federal open source repositories. It automatically calculates essential metadata, including labor hours, programming languages, and repository details, ensuring that all files adhere to required schema standards. The system facilitates accurate and timely updates by either pushing changes directly or creating pull requests for review. Furthermore, it incorporates robust validation checks that prevent invalid code. This ensures that only compliant and correctly formatted code.json files are merged into the main branch, significantly simplifying regulatory adherence for federal projects.",
